OL,3,ANews media must stay relevant or
OL,4,A'society will struggle', says World
OL,5,ANews Day organiser
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 1,000 news providers around
OL,8,Fthe world have signed up to support
OL,9,FWorld News Day on Monday, which aims to
OL,10,Fpromote the role of journalism at a
OL,11,Ftime when organisers say the industry
OL,12,Ffaces an "existential threat".
OL,14,FParticipating media organisations,
OL,15,Fincluding the New York Times, Reuters
OL,16,Fand the Kyiv Independent, are sharing
OL,17,Feditorials, ads and cartoons to
OL,18,Fhighlight the value of "trusted
OL,19,Fjournalism".
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
