OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANews media must stay relevant or
OL,4,A'society will struggle', says World
OL,5,ANews Day organiser
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrust in news dropped to a new low
OL,8,Fglobally in 2026, according to the
OL,9,FReuters Institute's latest Digital News
OL,10,FReport, which noted that people are
OL,11,Fincreasingly turning to social media
OL,12,Fand AI chatbots for news.
OL,14,FBranko Brkic, co-organiser of World
OL,15,FNews Day, said media organisations that
OL,16,Fwere once rivals must work together,
OL,17,Fadding: "If we do not change the game,
OL,18,Fwe are just not going to exist."
